- [ ] `docs/requirements.md` with personas, FR-xx, NFR-xx, scope, assumptions A1–A8, CSV contracts
- [ ] `docs/samples/` with every file in §4.4 and `samples/README.md` giving every record's expected outcome
- [ ] `docs/reconciliation-rules.md` with N1–N11, participation, match key, ordered outcomes, invariant, exception types, resolution codes, `discrepancy_key`, state machines, money rules
- [ ] `docs/architecture.md` with module/table ownership, allowed dependencies, sequence diagrams
- [ ] `docs/database-design.md` with ERD, constraint table, known partition-key gap, partitioning, migration policy
- [ ] `docs/api-design.md` with conventions, error catalogue, pagination, idempotency, concurrency, status codes
- [ ] `docs/adr/0000`–`0012` merged, all `Accepted`
- [ ] README "Open design questions" replaced by the decisions table
- [ ] TASKS.md updated with the scalability.md §9 changes and the corrected M2 exit criterion
- [ ] `ls docs/*.md docs/adr/*.md docs/samples/* | wc -l` matches the expected file count

